'''Moon''' is the 48th and final [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. It can only be played after all other Empire of Cats Zombie Outbreaks have been cleared. Completing this stage will increase the player's maximum [[Cat Energy|Energy]] capacity by 50 each Chapter, for a total increase of 150. [[Lord Gravey]] is introduced here in Chapter 1. [[Miss Haka]] is introduced in Chapter 2.

